msgid "Running Molpro on parallel computers"
msgstr "在并行计算机上运行 Molpro"

msgid ""
"Molpro will run on distributed-memory multiprocessor systems, including "
"workstation clusters, under the control of the `Global Arrays "
"<http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/docs/global>`__ parallel toolkit or the MPI-2 "
"library. There are also some parts of the code that can take advantage of "
"shared memory parallelism through the `OpenMP <http://www.openmp.org>`__ "
"protocol, although these are somewhat limited, and this facility is not at "
"present recommended. It should be noted that there remain some parts of the "
"code that are not, or only partly, parallelized, and therefore run with "
"replicated work. Additionally, some of those parts which have been "
"parallelized rely on fast inter-node communications, and can be very "
"inefficient across ordinary networks. Therefore some caution and "
"experimentation is needed to avoid waste of resources in a multiuser "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 可在分布式内存多处理器系统（包括工作站集群）上运行，由 `Global Arrays "
"<http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/docs/global>`__ 并行工具包或 MPI-2 库控制。代码中也有一些部分可以通过 "
"`OpenMP <http://www.openmp.org>`__ "
"协议利用共享内存并行性，尽管这些部分较为有限，并且目前不推荐使用此功能。需要注意的是，代码中仍有一些部分未并行化或仅部分并行化，因此会以重复工作的方式运行。此外，一些已并行化的部分依赖于快速的节点间通信，在普通网络上可能效率极低。因此，在多用户环境中需要谨慎并进行实验，以避免资源浪费。"

msgid "GA Installation notes"
msgstr "GA 安装说明"

msgid "Specifying parallel execution"
msgstr "指定并行执行"

msgid ""
"The following additional options for the ``molpro`` command may be used to "
"specify and control parallel execution. In addition, appropriate memory "
"specifications (``-m, -M, -G``) are important, see section `memory "
"specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__."
msgstr ""
"以下 ``molpro`` 命令的附加选项可用于指定和控制并行执行。此外，适当的内存规格（\\ ``-m, -M, -G``\\ ）也很重要，请参阅 "
"`memory specifications <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#memory-"
"specifications>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"``--all-outputs`` produces an output file for each process when running in "
"parallel."
msgstr "``--all-outputs`` 在并行运行时为每个进程生成一个输出文件。"

msgid "Memory specifications"
msgstr "内存规格"

msgid ""
"If the `#disk option <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-"
"option>`__ is disabled (the default) and one of the older GA runtimes "
"(``sockets``, ``openib``, etc.) is used: Sufficient amount of GA memory must"
" be specified by the ``-G`` or ``-M`` option (see below) and pre-allocated "
"by Molpro in the beginning of a calculation, otherwise the calculation may "
"crash or yields incorrect results."
msgstr ""
"如果 `#disk option <.html#disk-option>`__ 被禁用（默认）并且使用了较旧的 GA 运行时（如 "
"``sockets``\\ 、\\ ``openib`` 等）：必须通过 ``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项（见下文）指定足够的 GA 内存，并由 "
"Molpro 在计算开始时预分配，否则计算可能崩溃或产生错误结果。"

msgid ""
"If the disk option is disabled and one of the comex-based GA runtimes (e.g. "
"``mpi-pr``) is used, or if the disk option is enabled but the scratch is in "
"a tmpfs: the ``-G`` or ``-M`` option is not mandatory, but sufficient "
"physical memory shall be left for the global data structure."
msgstr ""
"如果磁盘选项被禁用且使用了基于comex的GA运行时（例如 ``mpi-pr``\\ ），或者磁盘选项已启用但临时目录位于tmpfs中：\\ "
"``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项不是强制性的，但应为全局数据结构预留足够的物理内存。"

msgid ""
"Note that we have made the disk option the default in single node "
"calculations since Molpro 2021.2. If this causes performance problems, the "
"previous behavior of storing large data structure in GlobalArrays can be "
"enabled by setting the environment variable ``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` to ``GA``, or"
" by passing the ``--ga-impl ga`` command-line option."
msgstr ""
"请注意，自Molpro 2021.2起，我们已在单节点计算中将磁盘选项设为默认。如果这导致性能问题，可以通过将环境变量 "
"``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` 设置为 ``GA``\\ ，或通过传递 ``--ga-impl ga`` "
"命令行选项，来启用将大型数据结构存储在GlobalArrays中的先前行为。"

msgid ""
"Both the ``-m`` and ``-G`` options are by default given in megawords (m) but"
" unit gigaword (g) can also be used (e.g. ``-m1000`` is equivalent to "
"``-m1000m`` and to ``-m1g``). The total memory :math:`M` per node allocated "
"by molpro amounts to :math:`(n \\cdot m+G)/N`, where :math:`n` is the total "
"number of processes (``-n`` option), :math:`m` is the stack memory per "
"process (``-m`` option), :math:`G` the GA memory (``-G`` option), and "
":math:`N` the number of nodes. In addition, at least 200 MW per process "
"should be added for the program itself. In total, a calculation needs about "
":math:`8\\cdot[n\\cdot(m+0.3)+G]/N` GB (gigabytes) of memory (:math:`n,m,G` "
"in gw), and this should not exceed the physical memory of the machine(s) "
"used. We do note that in many calculations leaving some memory for the "
"system to buffer I/O operations may improve the performance significantly."
msgstr ""
"``-m`` 和 ``-G`` 选项默认以兆字（m）为单位给出，但也可以使用千兆字（g）单位（例如，\\ ``-m1000`` 等价于 "
"``-m1000m`` 和 ``-m1g``\\ ）。Molpro为每个节点分配的总内存 :math:`M` 为 :math:`(n \\cdot "
"m+G)/N`\\ ，其中 :math:`n` 是进程总数（\\ ``-n`` 选项），\\ :math:`m` 是每个进程的栈内存（\\ ``-m``"
" 选项），\\ :math:`G` 是GA内存（\\ ``-G`` 选项），\\ :math:`N` 是节点数。此外，程序本身每个进程至少应增加200 "
"MW。总计，一次计算大约需要 :math:`8\\cdot[n\\cdot(m+0.3)+G]/N` GB（千兆字节）的内存（\\ "
":math:`n,m,G` "
"以gw为单位），且不应超过所用机器的物理内存。我们确实注意到，在许多计算中，为系统预留一些内存用于缓冲I/O操作可能会显著提高性能。"

msgid ""
"**Density fitting and PNO calculations**: divide the memory into equal parts"
" for GA and stack memory."
msgstr "**密度拟合和PNO计算**\\ ：将内存平均分配给GA和栈内存。"

msgid ""
"**Canonical MRCI or CCSD(T) calculations** on one-node: no GA space is "
"needed."
msgstr "**单节点上的正则MRCI或CCSD(T)计算**\\ ：不需要GA空间。"

msgid ""
"If the ``-G`` or ``-M`` options are given, some programs check at early "
"stages if the GA space is sufficient. If not, an error exit occurs and the "
"estimated amount of required GA is printed. In this case the calculation "
"should be repeated, specifying (at least) the printed amount of GA space "
"with the ``-G`` option. If crashes without such message occur, the "
"calculation should also be repeated with more GA space or with the disk "
"option, but care should be taken that the total memory per node does not get"
" too large."
msgstr ""
"如果给出了 ``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项，一些程序会在早期阶段检查 GA 空间是否足够。如果不够，会发生错误退出并打印估计所需的 GA "
"量。在这种情况下，应重复计算，并使用 ``-G`` 选项指定（至少）打印出的 GA 空间量。如果发生崩溃但没有此类消息，也应使用更多 GA "
"空间或磁盘选项重复计算，但应注意确保每个节点的总内存不会变得过大。"

msgid "The behavior of various option combinations is as follows:"
msgstr "各种选项组合的行为如下："

msgid "``-M`` As described above."
msgstr "``-M`` 如上所述。"

msgid ""
"``-m`` The specified amount of :math:`m` is allocated. An infinite amount of"
" GA space is assumed, but nothing is preallocated or checked."
msgstr "``-m`` 分配指定的 :math:`m` 量。假定 GA 空间无限，但不预分配或检查任何内容。"

msgid ""
"``-G`` The specified amount of :math:`G` is allocated, and the same total "
"amount for stack memory (i.e. :math:`M=2G`)."
msgstr "``-G`` 分配指定的 :math:`G` 量，并为栈内存分配相同的总量（即 :math:`M=2G`\\ ）。"

msgid "``nothing`` Same as -m32m."
msgstr "``nothing`` 与 -m32m 相同。"

msgid ""
"If the ``-G`` or ``-M`` are present, the GA space is preallocated unless GA "
"is using helper processes (i.e., a comix-based runtime is used and "
"preallocation of GA is not necessary). If neither ``-G`` nor ``-M`` are "
"given, no preallocation and no checks of GA space are performed."
msgstr ""
"如果存在 ``-G`` 或 ``-M``\\ ，则预分配 GA 空间，除非 GA 正在使用辅助进程（即，使用基于 comix 的运行时，且不需要预分配 "
"GA）。如果未给出 ``-G`` 或 ``-M``\\ ，则不执行 GA 空间的预分配和检查。"

msgid "Disk option"
msgstr "磁盘选项"

msgid ""
"Since version 2021.1, Molpro can use MPI files instead of GlobalArrays to "
"store large global data. This option can be enabled globally by setting the "
"environment variable ``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` to ``DISK``, or by passing the "
"``--ga-impl disk`` command-line option. Since version 2021.2 the disk option"
" is made the default in single-node calculations. Some programs in Molpro "
"including DF-HF, DF-KS, (DF-)MULTI, DF-TDDFT, and PNO-LCCSD also support an "
"input option ``implementation=disk`` to enable the disk option for the "
"particular job step. The file system for these MPI files must be accessible "
"by all processors. By default the default Molpro scratch directory is used, "
"but another directory can be chosen for MPI Files using the ``-D`` command "
"line option or the ``MOLPRO_GLOBAL_SCRATCH`` environment variable. The "
"directory can be tmpfs (e.g., ``-D /dev/shm``) in single-node calculations, "
"and in this case the GAs / MPI Files are kept in shared memory."
msgstr ""
"自 2021.1 版本起，Molpro 可以使用 MPI 文件代替 GlobalArrays 来存储大型全局数据。可以通过将环境变量 "
"``MOLPRO_GA_IMPL`` 设置为 ``DISK``\\ ，或传递 ``--ga-impl disk`` 命令行选项来全局启用此选项。自 "
"2021.2 版本起，磁盘选项在单节点计算中成为默认设置。Molpro 中的一些程序，包括 DF-HF、DF-KS、(DF-)MULTI、DF-"
"TDDFT 和 PNO-LCCSD，也支持输入选项 ``implementation=disk`` 来为特定作业步骤启用磁盘选项。这些 MPI "
"文件的文件系统必须对所有处理器可访问。默认情况下，使用默认的 Molpro 临时目录，但也可以使用 ``-D`` 命令行选项或 "
"``MOLPRO_GLOBAL_SCRATCH`` 环境变量为 MPI 文件选择另一个目录。在单节点计算中，该目录可以是 tmpfs（例如，\\ "
"``-D /dev/shm``\\ ），在这种情况下，GA / MPI 文件保存在共享内存中。"

msgid ""
"The performance of the disk option varies depending on the I/O capacity, "
"available system memory, the MPI software, and the nature of the "
"calculation. Usually, the best practice is to reserve some system memory for"
" the system to buffer I/O operations (i.e., not to allocate all available "
"memory to Molpro with ``-m`` or the ``memory`` input card). When this is "
"done the performance of single-node disk-based calculations can be "
"comparable to GA-based ones in many cases, in particular with SSDs."
msgstr ""
"磁盘选项的性能取决于 I/O 容量、可用系统内存、MPI 软件以及计算的性质。通常，最佳实践是为系统保留一些系统内存以缓冲 I/O 操作（即，不要使用 "
"``-m`` 或 ``memory`` 输入卡将所有可用内存分配给 Molpro）。这样做之后，单节点基于磁盘的计算性能在许多情况下可以与基于 GA "
"的计算相媲美，尤其是在使用 SSD 时。"

msgid "Embarrassing parallel computation of gradients or Hessians (mppx mode)"
msgstr "梯度或 Hessian 矩阵的易并行计算（mppx 模式）"

msgid ""
"The numerical computation of gradients or Hessians, or the automatic "
"generation of potential energy surfaces, requires many similar calculations "
"at different (displaced) geometries. An automatic parallel computation of "
"the energy and/or gradients at different geometries is implemented for the "
"gradient, hessian, and surf programs. In this so-called mppx-mode, each "
"processing core runs an independent calculation in serial mode. This happens"
" automatically using the ``-n`` available cores. The automatic mppx "
"processing can be switched off by setting option ``mppx=0`` on the ``OPTG``,"
" ``FREQ``, or ``HESSIAN`` command lines. In this case, the program will "
"process each displacement in the standard parallel mode."
msgstr ""
"梯度或 Hessian 矩阵的数值计算，或势能面的自动生成，需要在不同（位移）几何结构下进行许多类似的计算。对于梯度、hessian 和 surf "
"程序，实现了在不同几何结构下能量和/或梯度的自动并行计算。在这种所谓的 mppx 模式下，每个处理核心以串行模式运行独立的计算。这会自动使用 "
"``-n`` 个可用核心。可以通过在 ``OPTG``\\ 、\\ ``FREQ`` 或 ``HESSIAN`` 命令行上设置选项 ``mppx=0``"
" 来关闭自动 mppx 处理。在这种情况下，程序将以标准并行模式处理每个位移。"

msgid "Options for developers"
msgstr "开发者选项"

msgid "Debugging options"
msgstr "调试选项"

msgid "``--ga-debug`` activates GA debugging statements."
msgstr "``--ga-debug`` 激活 GA 调试语句。"

msgid "``--check-collective`` check collective operations when debugging."
msgstr "``--check-collective`` 在调试时检查集体操作。"

msgid "Options for pure MPI-based PPIDD build"
msgstr "纯基于 MPI 的 PPIDD 构建选项"

msgid ""
"This section is **not** applicable if the Molpro binary release is used, or "
"when Molpro is built using the GlobalArrays toolkit (which we recommend)."
msgstr ""
"本节内容\\ **不**\\ "
"适用于使用Molpro二进制发行版的情况，也不适用于使用GlobalArrays工具包构建Molpro的情况（我们推荐使用此方式）。"

msgid ""
"``--node-helper-server`` specifies one helper server on every node if all "
"the nodes are symmetric and have reasonable processes (i.e., every node has "
"the same number of processes, and the number should be greater than 1), and "
"this is the default behaviour. Otherwise, only one single helper server for "
"all processes/nodes will be used, and this will be equivalent to option "
"``--single-helper-server``"
msgstr ""
"``--node-helper-server`` "
"指定每个节点上一个助手服务器，前提是所有节点对称且具有合理的进程数（即每个节点具有相同数量的进程，且该数量应大于1），这是默认行为。否则，将为所有进程/节点仅使用一个单独的助手服务器，这将等同于选项"
" ``--single-helper-server``"

msgid ""
"``--single-helper-server`` specifies only one single helper server for all "
"processes."
msgstr "``--single-helper-server`` 指定仅为所有进程使用一个单独的助手服务器。"

msgid "``--no-helper-server`` disables the helper server."
msgstr "``--no-helper-server`` 禁用助手服务器。"

msgid ""
"In the cases of one or more helper servers enabled, one or more processes "
"act as data helper servers, and the rest processes are used for computation."
" Even so, it is quite competitive in performance when it is run with a large"
" number of processes. In the case of helper server disabled, all processes "
"are used for computation; however, the performance may not be good because "
"of the poor performance of some existing implementations of the MPI-2 "
"standard for one-sided operations."
msgstr ""
"在启用一个或多个助手服务器的情况下，一个或多个进程充当数据助手服务器，其余进程用于计算。即便如此，当使用大量进程运行时，其性能仍然相当有竞争力。在助手服务器被禁用的情况下，所有进程都用于计算；然而，由于某些现有MPI-2标准单边操作实现的性能不佳，性能可能不理想。"

msgid ""
"Molpro effects interprocess cooperation through MPI and the *ppidd* library,"
" which, depending on how it was configured and built, draws on either the "
"`GlobalArrays <http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/docs/global>`__ (GA) parallel toolkit"
" or pure MPI. *ppidd* is described in `Comp. Phys. Commun. 180, 2673-2679 "
"(2009) <http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2009.05.002>`__. The use of "
"GlobalArrays (GAs) is recommended for performances considerations. There are"
" different GA implementation options (runtimes), and there are advantages "
"and disadvantages for using one or the other implementation (see :doc:`GA "
"Installation <ga_installation>`)."
msgstr ""
"Molpro 通过 MPI 和 *ppidd* 库实现进程间协作，该库根据其配置和构建方式的不同，使用 `GlobalArrays "
"<http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/docs/global>`__\\ （GA）并行工具包或纯 MPI。\\ *ppidd* 的描述见 "
"`Comp. Phys. Commun. 180, 2673-2679 (2009) "
"<http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.cpc.2009.05.002>`__\\ 。出于性能考虑，推荐使用 "
"GlobalArrays（GAs）。GA 有多种实现选项（运行时），使用其中一种或另一种实现各有优缺点（参见 :doc:`GA 安装 "
"<ga_installation>`\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"**Since Molpro 2021.2 the `#disk option "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__ is used by "
"default** in single node calculation, in which case large data structures "
"are simply kept in MPI files. The behavior of previous versions can be "
"recovered by the ``--ga-impl ga`` command line option. However, ``--ga-impl "
"ga`` requires pre-allocation of GA memory in many calculations if the "
"``socket`` GA runtime is used, and failing to preallocate sufficient amount "
"of GA memory may lead to crashes or incorrect results. Preallocating GA is "
"not required with the ``mpi-pr`` runtime of GA or with the disk option."
msgstr ""
"**自 Molpro 2021.2 起，单节点计算中默认使用 `#disk 选项 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__**\\ "
"，此时大型数据结构直接保存在 MPI 文件中。可以通过 ``--ga-impl ga`` 命令行选项恢复先前版本的行为。然而，如果使用 "
"``socket`` GA 运行时，在许多计算中 ``--ga-impl ga`` 需要预分配 GA 内存，未能预分配足够的 GA "
"内存可能导致崩溃或错误结果。使用 GA 的 ``mpi-pr`` 运行时或 disk 选项时不需要预分配 GA。"

msgid ""
"Programs that use density fitting (e.g. df-hf, df-ks, df-multi, df-mp2) as "
"well as pno Programs (pno-[lru]ccsd(t)[-F12\\|) can run on multiple computer"
" nodes. However, a fast interconnect (e.g. Infiniband) is necessary to get "
"reasonable performance. For most other methods, in particular conventional "
"methods that use integrals stored on disk, multi-node calculations are "
"disabled, since no performance gain can be expected and memory requirements "
"could be exceedingly large."
msgstr ""
"使用密度拟合的程序（如 df-hf、df-ks、df-multi、df-mp2）以及 pno "
"程序（pno-[lru]ccsd(t)[-F12\\|）可以在多个计算节点上运行。然而，要获得合理的性能，需要快速互连（如 "
"Infiniband）。对于大多数其他方法，特别是使用存储在磁盘上的积分的传统方法，多节点计算被禁用，因为预期不会有性能提升，而且内存需求可能非常大。"

msgid "See :doc:`GA installation <ga_installation>`."
msgstr "参见 :doc:`GA 安装 <ga_installation>`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``-n`` :math:`|` ``--tasks`` *tasks*** specifies the number of parallel "
"processes to be set up, and defaults to 1."
msgstr "**``-n`` :math:`|` ``--tasks`` *\\ tasks*** 指定要设置的并行进程数，默认为 1。"

msgid ""
"**``-N`` :math:`|` ``--task-specification`` "
"*node1:tasks1,node2:tasks2:math:`\\dots`*** *node1, node2* etc. specify the "
"host names of the nodes on which to run. *tasks1, tasks2* etc. specify the "
"number of tasks on each node"
msgstr ""
"**``-N`` :math:`|` ``--task-specification`` *\\ node1:tasks1,node2:tasks2\\ "
":math:`\\dots`*** *\\ node1, node2\\ * 等指定运行所在节点的主机名。*\\ tasks1, tasks2* "
"等指定每个节点上的任务数"

msgid ""
"**``--ga-impl`` *method*** specifies the method by which large data "
"structure are held in parallel. Available options are ``GA`` (GlobalArrays, "
"default) or ``disk`` (MPI Files, see `#disk option "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__). This option is "
"most relevant on the more recent programs such as Hartree-Fock, DFT, "
"MCSCF/CASSCF, and the PNO programs."
msgstr ""
"**``--ga-impl`` *\\ method*** 指定并行保存大型数据结构的方法。可用选项为 ``GA``\\ "
"（GlobalArrays，默认）或 ``disk``\\ （MPI 文件，参见 `#disk 选项 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__\\ "
"）。此选项在较新的程序中最为相关，如 Hartree-Fock、DFT、MCSCF/CASSCF 以及 PNO 程序。"

msgid ""
"**``-D`` :math:`|` ``--global-scratch`` *directory*** specifies the scratch "
"directory for the program which is accessible by all processors in multi-"
"node calculations. This only affects parallel calculations with the `disk "
"option <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``-D`` :math:`|` ``--global-scratch`` *\\ directory*** "
"指定程序的临时目录，在多节点计算中所有处理器均可访问该目录。这仅影响使用 `disk 选项 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__ 的并行计算。"

msgid ""
"Large scale parallel Molpro calculations may involve significant amount of "
"global data structure. This concerns in particular :doc:`PNO-LCCSD "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` calculations, "
"and, to a lesser extent, also Hartree-Fock, DFT, and MCSCF/CASSCF "
"calculations. For these calculations, it may be necessary to share the "
"available memory of the machine between molpro \"stack\" memory (determined "
"by the ``-m`` command line option or the ``memory`` card in the input file) "
"and the GA memory (determined by the ``-G`` command line option):"
msgstr ""
"大规模并行 Molpro 计算可能涉及大量的全局数据结构。这尤其涉及 :doc:`PNO-LCCSD "
"<local_correlation_methods_with_pair_natural_orbitals_pnos>` 计算，其次也涉及 "
"Hartree-Fock、DFT 和 MCSCF/CASSCF 计算。对于这些计算，可能需要在 molpro \"stack\" 内存（由 ``-m``"
" 命令行选项或输入文件中的 ``memory`` 卡确定）和 GA 内存（由 ``-G`` 命令行选项确定）之间共享机器的可用内存："

msgid ""
"If the `#disk option <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-"
"option>`__ is enabled and the scratch directory is located on a physical "
"disk: the GA usage should be negligible and the **``-G`` or ``-M`` options "
"should not be given**. However, the performance of the calculation might be "
"better if some memory is left for the system to buffer the I/O."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了 `#disk 选项 <running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__ "
"且临时目录位于物理磁盘上：GA 的使用应可忽略不计，\\ **不应给出 ``-G`` 或 ``-M`` 选项**\\ "
"。然而，如果为系统留出一些内存用于缓冲 I/O，计算的性能可能会更好。"

msgid ""
"A proper ratio for the splitting between \"stack\" and GA memory depends on "
"the calculation and the system. Some experiments are usually required to "
"obtain optimal performance. As a rule of thumb, the following choice can be "
"used as a starting point:"
msgstr "\"stack\" 与 GA 内存之间的合理拆分比例取决于计算和系统。通常需要通过一些实验来获得最佳性能。作为经验法则，可以将以下选择作为起点："

msgid "**HF, DFT, and MCSCF calculations**: 75% for the stack and 25% for GA."
msgstr "**HF、DFT 和 MCSCF 计算**\\ ：75% 用于 stack，25% 用于 GA。"

msgid ""
"In order to facilitate the memory splitting, the ``-M`` option is provided "
"(in the following, its value is denoted :math:`M`). With this, the total "
"memory allocatable by Molpro can be specified, and the memory is split 50-50"
" for stack and GA in DF/PNO calculations, and 75-25 in other calculations. "
"Thus, unless specified otherwise, in DF/PNO calculations the stack memory "
"per process is :math:`m=M\\cdot N/(2\\cdot n)` and the total GA memory is "
":math:`G=N\\cdot M/2`. If the use of GA in storing large data structure is "
"desired, it is recommended to provide a default ``-M`` value in .molprorc "
"(**do not do so for disk-based calculation, see `#disk option "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__**), e.g. "
"``-M=25g`` for a dedicated machine with 256 GB of memory and 20 cores "
"(.molprorc can be in the home directory and/or in the submission directory, "
"the latter having preference). Then each Molpro run would be able to use the"
" whole memory of the machine with reasonable splitting between stack and GA."
" The default can be overwritten or modified by molpro command line options "
"``-m`` and/or ``-G``, or by input options (cf. section `memory allocation "
"<general_program_structure.html#memory-allocation>`__), the latter having "
"preference over command line options."
msgstr ""
"为便于内存拆分，提供了 ``-M`` 选项（下文中其值记为 :math:`M`\\ ）。通过该选项可以指定 Molpro 可分配的总内存，在 "
"DF/PNO 计算中内存按 50-50 拆分给 stack 和 GA，在其他计算中按 75-25 拆分。因此，除非另有指定，在 DF/PNO "
"计算中每个进程的 stack 内存为 :math:`m=M\\cdot N/(2\\cdot n)`\\ ，GA 总内存为 "
":math:`G=N\\cdot M/2`\\ 。如果希望在存储大型数据结构时使用 GA，建议在 .molprorc 中提供默认的 ``-M`` "
"值（\\ **对于基于磁盘的计算不要这样做，参见 `#disk 选项 "
"<running_molpro_on_parallel_computers.html#disk-option>`__**\\ ），例如对于具有 256 "
"GB 内存和 20 个核心的专用机器使用 ``-M=25g``\\ （.molprorc 可以位于主目录和/或提交目录中，后者优先）。这样每次 "
"Molpro 运行都能以合理的 stack 与 GA 拆分使用整台机器的内存。默认值可以通过 molpro 命令行选项 ``-m`` 和/或 "
"``-G``\\ ，或通过输入选项（参见 `内存分配 <general_program_structure.html#memory-"
"allocation>`__ 一节）覆盖或修改，后者优先于命令行选项。"

msgid ""
"Depending on the GA run time and the MPI library, the error messages from GA"
" allocation failures (with ``--ga-impl ga``) can be very deceptive. In our "
"tests with OpenMPI and the ``mpi-pr`` GA runtime, such allocation failures "
"usually show up as \"Bus error\", but sometimes no errors are shown at all."
msgstr ""
"取决于 GA 运行时和 MPI 库，GA 分配失败（使用 ``--ga-impl ga`` 时）产生的错误消息可能非常具有误导性。在我们使用 "
"OpenMPI 和 ``mpi-pr`` GA 运行时的测试中，此类分配失败通常表现为 \"Bus error\"，但有时根本不显示任何错误。"

msgid ""
"**``-M`` and ``-m``** The specified amount :math:`m` is allocated for each "
"core, the remaining memory for GA."
msgstr "**``-M`` 和 ``-m``** 为每个核心分配指定的量 :math:`m`\\ ，剩余内存用于 GA。"

msgid ""
"**``-M`` and ``-G``** The specified amount :math:`G` is allocated for GA, "
"and the remaining amount is split equally for stack memory of each process."
msgstr "**``-M`` 和 ``-G``** 为 GA 分配指定的量 :math:`G`\\ ，剩余量平均分配给每个进程的 stack 内存。"

msgid ""
"**``-M`` and ``-G`` and ``-m``** The specified amounts of :math:`m` and "
":math:`G` are allocated, and the :math:`M` value is ignored."
msgstr ""
"**``-M`` 和 ``-G`` 和 ``-m``** 分配指定的 :math:`m` 和 :math:`G` 量，忽略 :math:`M` 值。"

msgid ""
"**``-G`` and ``-m``** The specified amounts of :math:`m` and :math:`G` are "
"allocated."
msgstr "**``-G`` 和 ``-m``** 分配指定的 :math:`m` 和 :math:`G` 量。"

msgid ""
"With the disk option the problems associated with GA pre-allocation are "
"avoided. In this case use only ``-m`` or the ``memory`` card to specify "
"Molpro scratch memory for each processor. To avoid GA preallocation **do not"
" provide ``-M`` or ``-G``**. Please also make sure that ``-M`` and ``-G`` "
"are not present in ``.molprorc``, etc."
msgstr ""
"使用 disk 选项可避免与 GA 预分配相关的问题。在这种情况下，仅使用 ``-m`` 或 ``memory`` 卡为每个处理器指定 Molpro "
"临时内存。为避免 GA 预分配，\\ **不要提供 ``-M`` 或 ``-G``**\\ 。另请确保 ``.molprorc`` 等文件中不存在 "
"``-M`` 和 ``-G``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"In the case of the pure MPI implementation of PPIDD, there is a choice of "
"using either MPI-2 one-sided memory access, or devoting some of the "
"processes to act as data \"helpers\". It is generally found that performance"
" is significantly better if at least one dedicated helper is used, and in "
"some cases it is advisable to specify more. The scalable limit is to devote "
"one core on each node in a typical multi-core cluster machine, but in most "
"cases it is possible to manage with fewer, thereby making more cores "
"available for computation. The options below"
msgstr ""
"在 PPIDD 的纯 MPI 实现中，可以选择使用 MPI-2 单边内存访问，或将部分进程专门用作数据 "
"\"helper\"。通常发现，如果至少使用一个专用 "
"helper，性能会显著提高，在某些情况下建议指定更多。可扩展的极限是在典型的多核集群机器上每个节点专用一个核心，但在大多数情况下可以用更少的核心来管理，从而为计算提供更多核心。以下选项"

msgid ""
"**``--multiple-helper-server`` *nprocs_per_server*** enables the multiple "
"helper servers, and *nprocs_per_server* sets how many processes own one "
"helper server. For example, when total number of processes is specified as "
":math:`32` and :math:`nprocs\\_per\\_server=8`, then every :math:`8` "
"processes(including helper server) will own one helper server, and there are"
" :math:`4` helper servers in total. For any unreasonable value of "
":math:`nprocs\\_per\\_server` (i.e., any integer less than 2), it will be "
"reset to a very large number automatically, and this will be equivalent to "
"option ``--single-helper-server``."
msgstr ""
"**``--multiple-helper-server`` *\\ nprocs_per_server*** 启用多个 helper 服务器，*\\ "
"nprocs_per_server* 设置多少个进程拥有一个 helper 服务器。例如，当总进程数指定为 :math:`32` 且 "
":math:`nprocs\\_per\\_server=8` 时，每 :math:`8` 个进程（包括 helper 服务器）将拥有一个 helper"
" 服务器，总共有 :math:`4` 个 helper 服务器。对于 :math:`nprocs\\_per\\_server` "
"的任何不合理值（即任何小于 2 的整数），将自动重置为一个非常大的数，这等效于选项 ``--single-helper-server``\\ 。"
